-- the DME_/POS_/DRUG_ family columns together -- they do not sum to the TOT_
-- columns; families undercount the true total by roughly 21-40% depending on
-- which population you check (benes, suppliers, or services). Query the TOT_
-- columns only. BENE_DUAL_CNT and the BENE_CC_*_PCT columns are interval-
-- censored at 11 (publish 0 or >=11, never 1-10); a percentile or median off
-- those columns has a hole in the middle of the distribution, not a real
-- typical value. BENE_AVG_RISK_SCRE is the uncensored alternative.
